Emblem examples
===============

Every icon in this drawer is an Emblem icon: a default image from
ENVARC:sys/emblem with an emblem on it. Select one and choose
Icons > Information... to see the tool types that make it.

  Music       an emblem without a method: the settings decide
  Pictures    SHADOW
  Internet    GLOW
  Games       size 0,0 = the emblem's own size; NONE
  Downloads   another emblem
  Private     DARK on the default images
  Favourites  in the middle, and somewhere else when selected
  Old stuff   GRAY on the image and the emblem
  Tools       INTERNAL: the icon's own picture (a wrench) as the emblem
  ReadMe      this file: no IMAGE=, the emblem goes on its own picture

The drawers are empty. Copy them, or their tool types, as you like.
Emblem.guide (one drawer up) explains everything.
